      "message": "Fix up PR #1172\n\n- Use the new \"condition\" schema for extension and parameter dependencies\n- Create new parameters for each of the \"optional\" bits in `mctrctl`\n- Update the `sw_read` methods to respect the parameters and correctly\n  manipulate `mctrctl` as bits\n- Remove the `sw_read` method from `mctrctl`\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul A. Clarke <paul.clarke@qti.qualcomm.com>",
